## **TeslaSync Apple SwiftUI Component Library & Design Tokens Reference**

### **LOCALIZATION PATTERN**
The project uses **`LocalizedStringKey`** for component labels/titles throughout. Example from `ApiLogsPage.swift` (line 49):
```swift
TSPageTitle("translation.apiLogs.title")  // LocalizedStringKey, not String
```
For computed/dynamic strings: `String(localized:)` (line 42 in `ApiLogsPage.Table.swift`):
```swift
String(localized: "translation.apiLogs.noLogs")
```

